      "run": 0,
      "steps": 4,
      "narrative": "I entered the cramped galley, my senses immediately assaulted by the heavy salt air and the gritty texture of the environment. My objective was to explore and gather useful items that could potentially aid in my journey. There was a kettle on the floor, dented from use, and a doorway leading north.\n\nCuriously, I decided to check out the door, but found nothing of particular interest. I then ventured north into a store, a small room filled with empty shelves and the peculiar scent of paraffin. The only noteworthy item I found in the store was a coil of rope. I also found a stair going up to the east, but chose not to explore it further at this time.\n\nWith my objective fulfilled, I returned to the galley to consider my next move. The coil of rope might prove useful, but I needed to carefully plan my next steps to ensure my continued survival and success in this mysterious world.",
